; Aria's CO theme, "Last Accord" (BH2 Campaign: the Orange Star CO who is M25's final opponent): E minor, 128 bpm, 4-bar riff intro and a 32-bar loop. A guitar-driven finale: a singable lead-guitar hook over Em C G D, a rising B section (Am C G D) with a horn line, a bridge over C D Em G, and the hook again.
; Original notes; AW2's own voices; no rom lines.
song aria
tempo 128
meter 4/4
reverb 173
priority 0

inst rg = B.10 shift=20
inst rgm = B.11 shift=20
inst lead = A.38 shift=12
inst horn = A.111 shift=-12
inst fz = A.97 shift=24
inst kit = A.120
inst timp = A.47 shift=24

